                        <lb n="B1"/>ṭṭary=u nilattukku vaṭakku mēl-pāṟk' ellai koṭṭaḷi var <gap reason="lost" quantity="2" unit="character"/> kiḻakkum vatā-pāṟk' ellai ...
                        <lb n="B2"/>...
                        <lb n="B3"/>... Ip-peru
                        
                        <lb n="B4" break="no"/>ru nāṉk' ellaiyuḷḷ akappaṭṭa nilam ...
                        <lb n="B5"/>nilattukku ...
                        <lb n="B6"/>t=tiyaṉ ku <gap reason="lost"/> tiraḷaya<hi rend="grantha">nda</hi>-mūt=ti nilam vāravit=ta mēṟk' aṭai ...                   </p>
